__scene

section__
  @title "T121 - ACT2 - The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-north/frame-121.jpg"

  "Ice fog crawls over the yard while smiths hammer spearheads in the dark, filling the hall with iron and soot. Catelyn Stark presses you to act on the blackmail ledger tying bannermen to stolen grain, while Roose Bolton watches for hesitation that rivals can exploit before the next rider leaves camp. You are not adjudicating theory; you are deciding who moves, who waits, and who pays for that delay.

Distance has turned command into a trust problem: orders travel slowly, rumor travels first, and hungry bannermen improvise policy when your writ is late. If you act in open law, you may steady northern legitimacy while sacrificing tempo. If you act through sealed pressure, you can move faster now and spend trust you may need later.

The North still has room to choose methods, but not room to avoid cost. The next order goes out under your name, and it will be judged not by speeches but by how many fires are still lit when night closes again."

  choice__
    @target "T122 - ACT2 - The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action north_trust = clampStat(north_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Put the blackmail ledger tying bannermen to stolen grain before sworn witnesses, bind terms in writing, and accept immediate strain to preserve public legitimacy."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T123 - ACT2 - Winterfell Night Council before witnesses"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 2, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Handle the blackmail ledger tying bannermen to stolen grain through covert channels and selective disclosure, trading transparency for immediate command leverage."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "T122 - ACT2 - The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-north/frame-122.jpg"

  "Rime clings to the rafters of a longhall where dripping cloaks steam over coals and every whisper carries. Greatjon Umber presses you to act on a crown raven order that conflicts with local survival, while Galbart Glover watches for hesitation that rivals can exploit before the next rider leaves camp. You are not adjudicating theory; you are deciding who moves, who waits, and who pays for that delay.

Distance has turned command into a trust problem: orders travel slowly, rumor travels first, and hungry bannermen improvise policy when your writ is late. If you act in open law, you may steady northern legitimacy while sacrificing tempo. If you act through sealed pressure, you can move faster now and spend trust you may need later.

The North still has room to choose methods, but not room to avoid cost. The next order goes out under your name, and it will be judged not by speeches but by how many fires are still lit when night closes again."

  choice__
    @target "T123 - ACT2 - Winterfell Night Council before witnesses"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action north_trust = clampStat(north_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Put a crown raven order that conflicts with local survival before sworn witnesses, bind terms in writing, and accept immediate strain to preserve public legitimacy."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T124 - ACT2 - The Twins Debt Collection under wolf banners"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 7)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 2, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Handle a crown raven order that conflicts with local survival through covert channels and selective disclosure, trading transparency for immediate command leverage."
  __choice
