__section

section__
  @title "T133 - ACT2 - Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/02-act2-north/frame-133.jpg"

  "Ice fog crawls over the yard while smiths hammer spearheads in the dark, filling the hall with iron and soot. Catelyn Stark presses you to act on a legal claim over command and supply authority, while Roose Bolton watches for hesitation that rivals can exploit before the next rider leaves camp. You are not adjudicating theory; you are deciding who moves, who waits, and who pays for that delay.

Distance has turned command into a trust problem: orders travel slowly, rumor travels first, and hungry bannermen improvise policy when your writ is late. If you act in open law, you may steady northern legitimacy while sacrificing tempo. If you act through sealed pressure, you can move faster now and spend trust you may need later.

By now, every earlier compromise is due, and the North can no longer pretend delay is strategy. The next order goes out under your name, and it will be judged not by speeches but by how many fires are still lit when night closes again."

  choice__
    @target "T134 - ACT2 - Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action north_trust = clampStat(north_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Put a legal claim over command and supply authority before sworn witnesses, bind terms in writing, and accept immediate strain to preserve public legitimacy."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T135 - ACT2 - Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 2, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Resolve a legal claim over command and supply authority through sealed orders and deniable pressure, preserving short-term control while deepening future backlash."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T136 - ACT2 - Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower"
    @when ((wealth + essos_ties + dragon_factor) >= 10)
    @action wealth = clampStat(wealth - 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action dragon_factor = clampStat(dragon_factor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Spend treasury and outside contacts to accelerate a legal claim over command and supply authority, buying operational speed at the cost of northern autonomy."
  __choice
